-    <TD>Cell #1</TD>
-    <TD>Cell #2</TD>
-    <TD class=cell3>Cell #3</TD></TR></TBODY></TABLE>
-<P>See <A 
-href="http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-CSS2/tables.html#collapsing-borders">17.6.2 The 
-collapsing border model</A> for following tests: </P>
-<TABLE class=test2>
