-<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.01//EN">
-<head>
-<meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=ISO-8859-1">
-<title>CSS2 Table Backgrounds Test Suite</title>
